{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6XxeytIFZpRHfMn3Uda5kw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:55.705912+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/6XxeytIFZpRHfMn3Uda5kw","html":"<div><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/0NbKRRGLFiaDficvogLA9SX581TMQ8yazlib6y35G38B70aicCslsXSuPE8PPZrUz4OFibsGeb85uK1cTw2wY4IibycCAyicpiaOUAuVL4TlmpyxoNA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>2026年北京协和医学院肿瘤医院</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>第</span></span></strong></span><strong><span><span>十一届全国优秀大学生夏令营</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>中国医学科学院肿瘤医院于1958年建院，是北京协和医学院的研究生培养单位，是国家卫生健康委所属三级甲等肿瘤专科医院，是国家癌症中心依托单位。2021年成为首批“辅导类”国家医学中心，是国家恶性肿瘤临床医学研究中心、国家肿瘤规范化诊治质控中心、国家药物临床研究中心、临床研究国家级质量评价和促进中心，以及国家抗肿瘤药物监测网所在地，是集医、教、研、防于一体的国家级肿瘤防治中心。</span></p><p><span>第十一届全国优秀大学生夏令营活动旨在促进“双一流”建设，搭建全国优秀医学本科毕业生与肿瘤医学领域科研、临床、预防专家的高水平交流平台，发掘和吸纳具备科研潜力、创新思维与专业素养的优秀后备人才，为有志于肿瘤医学研究的青年学子提供近距离了解我院学科建设、科研平台、师资力量的学习观摩机会。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/0NbKRRGLFiaCplAr76jwic3URNiah6rGNPGnTy1mMwQ0xO274SQWDBo3J5LQmYw6buMXJVNDglDJtY39XQ5Llia3XtO86sMIEqKdth7xVicbAy5Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span><br/></span></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/0NbKRRGLFiaBfMrmYseV3IqQottXIkFmsjcxTMYH3ztn77PYvVbaBJibMIGia07s6YKqZyOXyuqhibIuVKf8896A19wCTdhOZ7PBl03Sa7AlczU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>01 活动安排</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）报名时间</span></strong></p><p><span>6月18日（周四）至6月28日（周日）</span></p><p><strong><span>（二）公布入营名单</span></strong></p><p><span>7月15日（周三）</span></p><p><strong><span>（三）夏令营</span></strong></p><p><span>7月23日（周四）至7月24日（周五）</span></p><p><span>计划录取营员200人左右，入营名单将在我院官网公布。夏令营活动包括开营式、座谈交流、校园游、评选优秀营员等。</span><span><span>夏令营期间不提供住宿。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>02 学科方向与类型</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（一）学术型：</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>肿瘤学（基础、外科、内科、妇科、放射物理学、放射治疗学、中西医结合）、细胞生物学、免疫学、流行病与卫生统计学、病理学与病理生理学、影像医学与核医学、药剂学、生物医学工程、临床检验诊断学</span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（二）专业型：</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>肿瘤学（外科学方向、内科学方向、妇产方向）、放射肿瘤学、放射影像学、超声医学、临床病理、麻醉学、医学技术、公共卫生硕士、临床检验诊断学</span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（三）了解更多导师风采请搜索以下网址</span></span></strong></p></section></section><p><span>https://yzbss.pumc.edu.cn/basicinfo/tutorinfo/tutorcollege/003</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>03 申请资格</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>招生对象为 2027 年应届本科毕业生，“985 工程”“211工程”“双一流”建设高校在读学生优先，具备或有望获得本科推免资格者优先；</span></p><p><span>思想品德优良、学风端正、遵纪守法，在校期间学业成绩优异，平均学分绩点对应成绩85分及以上，无任何不及格、补考记录；</span></p><p><span>外语水平良好，大学英语六级成绩450分及以上，或大学英语四级成绩470分或以上，具备良好的英文文献阅读与学术交流能力；</span></p><p><span>热爱医学与生命科学领域，对肿瘤医学相关研究具备浓厚兴趣，有科研项目参与、学术竞赛、论文发表等相关科研经历者优先。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>04 提交材料</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>各申请人务必保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性，若有虚报、谎报等不端行为，一经查实，将取消入营资格。</span></span></strong></p><p><span>(一) 个人证件照片（限100K内），以jpg格式在报名系统上传；</span></p><p><span>(二) 成绩单（须加盖院系或学校教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>(三) 总评成绩排名证明（须加盖院系或学校教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><span>(四) 国家英语四六级考试、托福、雅思、GRE等英语水平的成绩证明；</span></p><p><span>(五) 荣誉与奖励证书复印件；</span></p><p><span>(六) 发表文章（只需文章首页并标出作者）；</span></p><p><span>(七) 原创性工作成果；</span></p><p><span>(八) 需1-2位副教授及以上职称专家签字的推荐信。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>注：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.第1项个人证件照以jpg格式在报名系统上传；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.第2-8项请通过扫描等方式处理生成一份PDF格式的电子文件在夏令营申请系统中上传，文件名为：姓名+目前所在专业+所在高校，PDF文件大小在8M以内。其中1-4项为必需提供项，5-8项为选择性提供项。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>05 报名方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>请于</span><strong><span>2026年6月18日</span></strong><span>至</span><strong><span>6月28日24:00</span></strong><span>之前扫描下方二维码进行填写申报信息。请确认所填联系方式准确无误。被录取营员名单将于</span><strong><span>2026年7月15日</span></strong><span>前在我院官网上公布，届时统一安排具体参营事宜。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/0NbKRRGLFiaBT9voZiaWuZlsDxcs56yGCumvdG73UwXCvpfpxt8iacxJ07IZrJKiaHg9qf6JazMiaPhuwpoo9MOuS54j9hGOerfEMQiaibP0FhK8Mg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>夏令营报名二维码</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><sec